" CloudTrain KQL workstation: KQL files (.kql) edit like plain text with sensible defaults
syntax on
filetype plugin indent on
set expandtab tabstop=4 shiftwidth=4 softtabstop=4 autoindent
set number ruler showmatch
set backspace=indent,eol,start
autocmd BufRead,BufNewFile *.kql,*.csl setlocal filetype=sql commentstring=//\ %s
